I don't see why beginners should be treated as if they were incapable
of using their brains. All of the above are useful sources of information
on Lojban for anyone who wants it. They may contradict one another
here and there, mostly in minor points. So what? Even when things
are officially published, they will inevitably contain glitches. What do
you suggest we do when someone asks about a controversial topic?
"You'll find out when you grow up"? As far as I'm concerned, there is
nothing in Lojban that a beginner who is interested can't handle from
the very moment they start learning the language, if they are interested.

